WEBVTT

00:16:59.781 --> 00:17:01.670
No ako ste optmističan pingvin

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.466
koji vjeruje da može letjeti,

00:17:03.466 --> 00:17:06.129
no koji priveže padobran za leđa

00:17:06.129 --> 00:17:09.146
za slučaj da stvari ne ispadnu onako kako ste planirali,

00:17:09.146 --> 00:17:11.009
letjet ćete poput orla,

00:17:11.009 --> 00:17:14.058
čak i ako ste samo pingvin.

00:17:14.058 --> 00:17:15.820
Hvala vam.

00:17:15.820 --> 00:17:18.756
(Pljesak)